100: /**
101:  * Weather comes in episodes, not as a permanent fixture: a gust of leaves
102:  * every minute or so, snow that thickens and thins. Both are rolled off the
103:  * shared clock (`ambientSchedule.ts`), so every client on the map sees the
104:  * same gust at the same second - the calm stretches are the point, a field
105:  * that always has leaves in it stops reading as wind.
