116: /**
117:  * A current, not a gust. Water has too much inertia to blow in bursts: it
118:  * swells and slackens over a couple of minutes and it is never quite still.
119:  * So this rolls nine slots in ten, runs for most of the slot it rolls, and
120:  * even its weakest episode peaks at three fifths of the rate.
