388:       // prune below were *deleting live textures*: `Object1/Light01.glb` came
389:       // out with its `ston03` image, its texture and its material reference
390:       // gone entirely, and `Player/ArmorElf01.glb` lost `Player/hide`. That
391:       // second one is not just an untextured mesh - this runtime reads render
